flowchart LR
    DEV[Feature Branch] --> PR[Pull Request]
    PR --> FMT[Terraform Format]
    PR --> VAL[Validate Dev QA Prod]
    PR --> LINT[TFLint]
    PR --> SEC[Checkov]
    FMT --> MERGE[Merge to Main]
    VAL --> MERGE
    LINT --> MERGE
    SEC --> MERGE
    MERGE --> DDEV[Automatic Dev Apply]
    DDEV --> QA[Manual QA Promotion]
    QA --> PROD[Protected Production Promotion]
